            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "OptiTap is the common name for a hardened, sealed fiber drop connector format, first designed by one manufacturer and now available as compatible connectors from several sources. It lets a pre-connectorized drop be plugged into a terminal outdoors, in minutes and without splicing. Vocom supplies OptiTap compatible connectors rated IP68 and built to GR-326 and GR-3120, alongside flat drop cable."
